  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:302px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/TownstonsCommander.jpg\" title=\"The Townston Commander\"><img alt=\"The Townston Commander\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"252\" src=\"/images/TownstonsCommander.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/TownstonsCommander.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>The Townston Commander</div></div></div>\n<p>The Townston Commander is just up the steps from the <a href=\"/wiki/Obelisk\" title=\"Obelisk\">Obelisk</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a>. \n</p><p>He gives many quests.   Always check <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Townston_Commander_Quests\" title=\"Category:Townston Commander Quests\">Townston Commander Quests</a> before beginning any dungeon, and when completing a Level or a dungeon off, as he may have new quests to offer.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Voices\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Voices </span></h2>\n<object data=\"/thetownstons/extensions/audio_player/player.swf\" height=\"24\" id=\"audioplayer1\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"290\"><param name=\"movie\" value=\"/thetownstons/extensions/audio_player/player.swf\"/><param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"playerID=1&amp;soundFile=/thetownstons/images/TownstonCommander.mp3\"/><param name=\"quality\" value=\"high\"/><param name=\"menu\" value=\"false\"/><param name=\"wmode\" value=\"transparent\"/></object>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
